                <pb facs="0249" n="237" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg237"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 Lane, Clayton/118: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Mr.
                            William Phillips, Personal Representative
                        of President Roosevelt in India</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-04-26T21:00:00-04:00">April 26, 1943—9
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>216. Your 288, April 16, 2 p.m. Lane’s designation as Commercial Attaché
                    canceled.</p>
                <p>In lieu thereof, he is designated Secretary with the additional title of Director
                    of War Economic Operations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
